<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- R.I. housing bonds at 0945 EDT.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- R.I. housing bonds at 0945 EDT.</headline>
<text>
<p>RHODE ISLAND HOUSING AND MORTGAGE</p>
<p>FINANCE CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $18,585,000</p>
<p>MULTI-FAMILY HOUSING BONDS, 1997 SER. A (NON-AMT)</p>
